-- Seed: MORA/KHEU prayer times, 2025-01-09 .. 2026-12-31 (Brunei & Muara).
-- One row per prayer time; generated from the MORA SharePoint list.
-- Source: 2025-01-01..2025-01-08 are absent from MORA and therefore omitted.
-- Source cell typos corrected from the adjacent days: 2025-12-29 maghrib
-- (6.`7 -> 6.17), 2026-01-22 isyak (741 -> 7.41), 2026-03-24 zuhur
-- (112.28 -> 12.28), 2026-04-23 syuruk (69.11 -> 6.11), 2026-07-16 isyak
-- (7..52 -> 7.52). Stray duplicate rows for 2026-03-17, 2026-06-18 and
-- 2026-07-16 were dropped.
on conflict (prayer_date, district, prayer) do update set
  time = excluded.time,
  hijri_date = excluded.hijri_date,
  source_url = excluded.source_url,
  updated_at = now();
